  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Sprinting for ? seconds with full Class Ability Energy grants a 50 HP frontal overshield. Shield grants x1 <arc/> Bolt Charge per hit absorbed.\n\nWhile <arc/>Amplified, the shield gains an additional 33% damage resistance, effectively increasing to 67 HP.\n\nThis overshield grants <pve 60% /> <pvp [10%] /> Splash Damage Resistance, and an additional <pve 10% /> Damage Resistance against combatants. \n\nUpon being destroyed, Overshield consumes your Class Ability Energy. Overshield will fully absorb any overkill damage on the last hit.\n\nJuggernaut Overshield stacks with other Overshields.",
      "updatedAt": "2026-05-22T21:11:11.952Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
